_normal.png?m=1618586856\" alt=\"lujiaosama\" data-uid=\"415096\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>17</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/lujiaosama\">lujiaosama</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-30 17:15:08 +08:00\">15h 21m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>还没感觉到特别大的降智,之前 GPT5.5 是弱智到不如 DSV4</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17922424\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d493/39ba/402341_normal.png?m=1781396324\" alt=\"hanbaoji\" data-uid=\"402341\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>21</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/hanbaoji\">hanbaoji</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-30 21:29:31 +08:00\">11h 7m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>很好用啊，你用的中转吧？但是有一说一，5.6 得 high 及以上才发挥得出来</p><p>5.5 才是特么的真降智，基本都又用 5.6sol 修修补补了一遍</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17922447\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/9bba5ba7e05ad56f263797e605bed21f?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Badlion\" data-uid=\"179227\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>22</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Badlion\">Badlion</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-30 21:41:41 +08:00\">10h 55m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>5.6 sol high 这个星期以来的输出品质真不行。更换 opus5 后把所有问题完美解决.</p>\n                </td>\n            <